
# 🚗 Vehicle Maintenance Performance Dashboard  
**Full-Stack React + Spring Boot + SQL Server/Postgres + Docker + Copilot (Ollama)**

---

# 📌 Project Overview
This project is a **production-style maintenance insights dashboard** built to demonstrate full-stack engineering skills including:

- React + TypeScript frontend
- Spring Boot REST API backend
- JPA/Hibernate database joins
- Dockerized multi-container deployment
- Lookup tables (Twin + Creator)
- CRUD forms with calendar inputs
- AI Copilot integration via Ollama

The application allows users to:

✅ View “Top Successful Actions / Insights”  
✅ Create / Edit / Delete records  
✅ Select Twin & Creator via dropdown lookups  
✅ Choose dates using calendar picker  
✅ Visualize performance using charts  

---

# 🏗️ Architecture

```
React (Vite)
     │ REST API
     ▼
Spring Boot Backend
     │ JPA / Hibernate
     ▼
Database (Postgres / SQL)
```

Docker containers run the entire stack.

---

# ▶️ To Run

1) Start containers

```
docker compose up --build
```

2) Pull AI model (first time only)

```
docker exec -it vehiclemaintenanceperformance-ollama-1 ollama pull mistral
```

3) Open application

```
http://localhost:5173/
```

---

# 📦 Container Names

Verify using:

```
docker ps
```

Expected containers:

```
vehiclemaintenanceperformance-frontend-1
vehiclemaintenanceperformance-backend-1
vehiclemaintenanceperformance-db-1
vehiclemaintenanceperformance-ollama-1
```

---

# 🔧 Useful Docker Commands

Start in background:
```
docker compose up -d --build
```

Stop containers:
```
docker compose down
```

Rebuild without cache:
```
docker compose build --no-cache
```

Backend logs:
```
docker compose logs -f backend
```

Frontend logs:
```
docker compose logs -f frontend
```

Enter backend shell:
```
docker exec -it vehiclemaintenanceperformance-backend-1 sh
```

